<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Blizzard</h1>
<p>Sphere: Frost Sphere
Spell Tier: 4
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 70, up to 90%)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast blizzard</a>
</pre>
<p>The caster points to the north and screams 'borealis', and a blizzard 
sweeps the room. It strikes everyone in it except the caster, the caster's 
leader and everyone who follows that leader; other players only when both 
you and they have signed the Book of Blood. Each one hit takes a modest 
amount of frost damage, about the same whatever armour they wear; a shield 
softens it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight with everyone it hits. It can be 
cast while fighting, and no free hands are needed. It is also found on 
wands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Snowball</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Frostball</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cold Resistance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Frost Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>